{
 "source": "trapp",
 "book": "2CH",
 "chapter": 5,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.5.1",
   "range": "2CH.5.1",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "9ccf96bb",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.5.1#p1-9ccf96bb",
     "text": "See 1Ki 7:51.",
     "anchor": "Thus all the work.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 7:51",
       "ref": "1KI.7.51"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.5.2",
   "range": "2CH.5.2",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "7d14ba87",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.5.2#p1-7d14ba87",
     "text": "See for this whole chapter following, 1Ki 8:1-12. {See Trapp on \"1Ki 8:1\"} &c",
     "anchor": "Then Solomon assembled, &c.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 8:1-12",
       "ref": "1KI.8.1-12"
      },
      {
       "text": "1Ki 8:1",
       "ref": "1KI.8.1"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.5.3",
   "range": "2CH.5.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "b374f2a0",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.5.3#p1-b374f2a0",
     "text": "Called Ethanim: haply from the many festivals therein observed. And Solomon fitly taketh that time for the dedication of the temple.",
     "anchor": "In the seventh month."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.5.9",
   "range": "2CH.5.9",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "b15bed91",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.5.9#p1-b15bed91",
     "text": "i.e., Until the time that the larger Chronicles of the Kings of Judah out of which Ezra compiled this abstract - were written.",
     "anchor": "And there it is unto this day"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.5.11",
   "range": "2CH.5.11",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "6b767122",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.5.11#p1-6b767122",
     "text": "Because the work was extraordinary.",
     "anchor": "And did not then wait by course."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.5.12",
   "range": "2CH.5.12",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "fafa42b2",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.5.12#p1-fafa42b2",
     "text": "Which might remind them of that innoceney and integrity required of them.",
     "anchor": "Being arrayed in white linen."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.5.13",
   "range": "2CH.5.13",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "8c75e31a",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.5.13#p1-8c75e31a",
     "text": "Signifying that unanimity and good agreement that must be amongst ministers, yea, all Christians.",
     "anchor": "Were even as one, to make one sound."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.5.14",
   "range": "2CH.5.14",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "8a71b536",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.5.14#p1-8a71b536",
     "text": "This showed that that Levitical ministry should cease when the Lord Christ came.",
     "anchor": "So that the priests could not stand."
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
